@AutoHub.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5116

### Login (admin de desarrollo: admin@autohub.local / Admin123!)
# @name login
POST {{AutoHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@autohub.local",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

###

@token = {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Usuario actual (requiere Bearer)
GET {{AutoHub.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###
